window.products.push({"id":600128,"name":"High Pressure Steam Cleaner, 1700W Handheld High Temp steamer for cleaning,Tankless and Adjusting the degree of steam dryness and humidity,steam clean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YaPjs+b5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【1700W HIGH POWER】Steamer for car detailing makes steam be ready in 20 seconds, up to 221℉(close to nozzle).Steam cleaner for upholstery can release about 3~5 BAR of high pressure steam. Through the high-pressure high-temperature steam and strong spray force, the cleaning job is done perfectly. 【TANKLESS DESIGN】Steam cleaner for car has a built-in 3.3-foot water inlet hose. Handheld steam cleaner can insert into the external bucket as a water source.No built-in water tank design makes the steam pressure washer lightweight to carry and don't have to constantly refill the tank. 【WITH STEAM HUMIDITY ADJUSTMENT】Car detailing steamer can adjust the degree of wet and dry steam according to your needs. It can meet your needs for cleaning different products. Wet steam is suitable for washing kitchen oil/floor stains/tile mud/bathroom dirt. Dry steam is suitable for cleaning sofas/mattresses/car interiors. 【UPGRADE MOTOR & CONTROL HANDLE】 steam machine uses an upgraded motor for corrosion resistance. You can add a specified cleaning agent (citric acid/baking soda) to the water to make your cleaning easier. At the same time, grout steamer can control the steam injection situation through the handle with one button. And the handle can be locked to prevent accidental touch from being scalded by steam. 【SAFE DESIGN & TIPS】 Designed with overheating protection, leakage protection, safe to use. Tips: (1) Do not add other cleaning agents except citric acid and baking soda to the water to prevent damage to the machine; (2) According to the instructions in the manual, descale regularly to obtain clean steam. (3) Every time before turning on the steam switch, use the cold water function to pump water to the machine. Prevent dry burning from damaging the machine. 【BUYERS TO KNOW & WARRANTY】If you find any parts are damaged after receiving product, just contact us, and we promise we provide you with free replacement. Also, any questions or needs during use, email us for help at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YaPjs+b5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yestoy","source_asin":"B0BN2XZZ4Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN2XZZ4Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN2XZZ4Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
