window.products.push({"id":600312,"name":"The Purple Sheets (White, Twin/Twin XL)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oBQ2pNVWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VISCOSE BAMBOO SHEETS- Purple Sheets are made of super soft material to keep you pleasantly comfortable while you sleep. We made these bed sheets with a specialized blend of 10% Spandex and 90% Bamboo-derived Viscose fabric. The advantage is that this special combination helps regulate your body temperature so you don’t get too hot or too cold. DEEP POCKET SHEET SET- Our fitted sheet set has deep pockets for mattresses up to 13” high, in sizes twin, twin xl sheets, full, xl full, queen, king sheets, and California King. For twin and XL twin size, the set has one flat sheet, one fitted sheet, and one pillowcase. All other sets come with one flat, one fitted, and two pillowcases. Colors available include white, slate gray, sand, and purple. ULTRA-STRETCHY- You’ll want to go to bed early once you have Purplesheets. Made with Spandex, they stretch and flex whenever you do. If you are fed up with all the hype about thread counts in sheets, fret no more! More threads mean a tighter weave, which means less circulation and breathability. Our sheets are softer than jersey sheets, and even better, because ours stay cooler in the heat. **Due to limited supply, there is no trial or return policy for the Purple Sheets.** IOUS- Let your skin breathe – and feel free to sleep in – when you are surrounded by Purple. The ultra smooth blend of materials give the luxurious feel of being royalty. Our bamboo bed sheets feature luxurious softness and extra circulation, so you don’t have to keep trying to find the cool spot. The soft material in our sheets lets you sleep more comfortably and soundly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oBQ2pNVWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Purple","source_asin":"B077YS5GGH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077YS5GGH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077YS5GGH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
