window.products.push({"id":600315,"name":"HomChic Jacquard Heavy Weight Soft Luxurious Long Lasting Spillproof Easy Care Tablecloth (Dusty Blue, 60x60 Inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jWifx7iZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHIC, MODERN, & SPILL RESISTANT DINING TABLECLOTHS - HomChic party tablecloth strikes the perfect balance between practicality and elegance, making your wish to maintain a well-kept home a reality. Using the latest coating technology any liquid spilled instantly beads up and leaves no stain if you quickly wipe away. DELUXE WEAVE WITH FLAWLESS DESIGNS - This luxury table cloth masterful weaving adds a modern twist to classic patterns - complementing any décor or table scheme. The magical, eye-catching sheen changes color depending on the angle you stand - accentuating its splendor. Available in Modern Leaves or Geometric Squares. 240 GSM, CRAFTED FOR LONGEVITY - Using the finest, heavy polyester fabric HomChic dining table covers have the highest thread count of 240 GSM. Your new table cloths for parties are resistant to discoloration, fading, pulls, staining, stretching, or shrinking. And, thanks to its immaculate stitching, it will maintain its splendid look for many years to come. SIZED JUST RIGHT - Whether you want a special shimmery table cloth for your storied family get-togethers or want to replace your worn-out linen, the choice is simple. Available in 52x70, 60x84, 60x104, and 60x120 in rectangle and 60x60 square. You’re sure to find the fancy tablecloth size you need and upgrade your dining collection. THE HOMCHIC GUARANTEE -We believe nothing should be complicated when it comes to shopping for new home décor. That’s why we’re offering you a 30-Day Refund in case you are in any way dissatisfied with your purchase. So, start drawing up your next guest list, add your brand-new french jacquard tablecloth to your cart >>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jWifx7iZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMCHIC","source_asin":"B08MB8272N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MB8272N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MB8272N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
