window.products.push({"id":600558,"name":"YISONHO Metal 3-Shelf Toilet Storage Rack Bathroom Corner Freestanding Storage Over Toilet Shelf Paper Holder Organizer Towels Plants Books (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UMYiBGZUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Sturdy Structure】 Safe and healthy, strong and durable, this over-the-toilet storage is made with extra thick rust-resistant steel, makes it solid and durable for years, while the reinforcement stickers in the back help keeping the rack in balance, stable while storing your various kinds of personal stuffs, suitable for wet environments in the bathroom. 【Ample Storage Space & Adjustable Bottom Bar】 Featuring 3-tire shelves with high fence, the toilet rack provides you spacious storage room by ensuring all items not easy to drop. This 3-tier bathroom shelf is a smart choice to get additional bathroom organization without taking up much of the floor space. Besides, the additional bottom bar can be adjusted, allows it to be assembled it just over the toilet no matter if there's a pipe in the back. 【Multiple Usages】 Three shelves design is designed to maximize your bathroom organization, provides extra space to store or place bathroom essentials such as towels, shampoo, detergent powder and all other stuffs. Moreover, the shelf in different colors could also be used as a bookshelf or plant shelf for magazines, plant pots or other trivial items. The unit also serves as a storage unit over any suitable fixture for your house. 【Perfect Stability】 Stable while storing your towels and various kinds of bathroom essentials, and after refined-craft treatment, the whole set is waterproof, rust-resistant and durable for long serving time. The unit is also equipped with non-slip foot pads to protect the floor from scratches. 【Easy Assembly】 Comes with step-by-step installation instructions to ensure the item assembly easy, including hardware. Quickly assemble easy-to-follow manual with NO TOOLS required, and the extra reinforcement stickers keep the shelves in balance thus you can enjoy the bathroom storage shelf over the toilet space saver shelf in a second for your organized bathroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UMYiBGZUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YISONHO","source_asin":"B092J6JG9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092J6JG9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092J6JG9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
