window.products.push({"id":600622,"name":"Grounding Mattress Cover for Bed (Split King Size), grounding Sheets for Earthing, Improve Sleep with Clint Ober's GROUND THERAPY Products (Also Onlin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":449.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XnE-yV6BS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Leather GROUNDING: When you take off your shoes and walk barefoot on the earth outside, the earth's electrons flow into you. The same thing happens when you touch Ground Therapy products inside your home. (Does not use electricity.) SAFE & NON-TOXIC MATERIALS: This SPLIT KING Grounding Mattress Cover is made with eco-friendly and non-toxic materials. It utilizes a vegan leather vinyl-free PU resin that’s infused with carbon pigment and TPE closed-cell foam. EASY TO USE: First test your wall outlet with the included Outlet Checker to make sure it's grounded. Next, connect your SPLIT KING Ground Therapy Grounding Mattress Cover into your U.S. Safety Adapter and snap it onto the grounding sheet. Lay down and you're grounding! COMPLETE KIT: 2 Ground Therapy Grounding Mattress Cover TWIN XL size, 2 Coil Cords with in-line current limiting 100k ohm resistors (15') , 1 U.S. Safety Adapter, 1 Outlet Tester, PLUS a FREE copy of the book 'Earthing: The Most Important Health Discovery Ever!' CLINT OBER OFFICIAL: Ground Therapy products are one of two official grounding product lines created by Clint Ober. They are patent-protected and come with a one year manufacturer's warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XnE-yV6BS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ground Therapy","source_asin":"B09BSJRSVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BSJRSVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BSJRSVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
