window.products.push({"id":600713,"name":"5 Gallon Cornelius Keg, Ball Lock (Used)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QQkAseniL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Used & Pressure Tested Ball Lock Keg - Includes Pressure Relief Valve Lid Pressure tested 5 gallon, stainless steel, cornelius style tanks. These tanks are guaranteed to hold pressure. 25\" tall and 8.5\" diameter. May have stickers on kegs. May also have syrup residue in tanks as we only dump them. Kegs typically include the o-rings and poppets that were installed when we received the tanks. We will sometimes change an o-ring or poppet to get the tank to hold pressure.  If you are just getting into kegging you will need a kegging setup to go with these kegs. We sell picnic tap systems, tower systems, and kegerator systems. We know some homebrewers are more picky than others, so please keep in mind that these are USED kegs. Some of these kegs are probably 30 years old. Do not expect new kegs. If you are looking for new kegs, please check out our new kegs. We try and have quality kegs available at all times. With this said, they are going to show normal wear and tear. We are not implying that our kegs are not quality...we just want to avoid any misunderstandings. Most of the kegs have black protective tops and bottoms, some are blue. We may have a few green, red or yellow tops.  If you are unhappy with your used 5 Gallon Cornelius Kegs for any reason, we will gladly take them back. The purchaser will be responsible for return shipping charges.There are several different post sizes for ball lock kegs but all posts can be removed with a standard set of deep well sockets, ALL, no special tools are required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QQkAseniL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adventures in Homebrewing","source_asin":"B07F8XVT1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600713","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F8XVT1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F8XVT1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
