window.products.push({"id":600749,"name":"UOZZI BEDDING Fur Bed in a Bag 6 Pieces Faux Fur Comforter Set King Size Luxury Warm Winter Shaggy Comforter Set - White Fluffy Comforter + Flannel Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710GraESjBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What you can get: King 1x Shaggy Comforter(102\"x 90\"),2 x Faux Fur pillowcases (20\"x36\"), 2 x quilted flannel pillowcases (20\"x36\"), 1 Flannel Bed Skirt (78\" W x 80\" L with a 18\" drop) Material-Comforter：A side of the comforter is Ultra Soft Faux Fur plush polyster while B side is Super Warm Sherpa. This 2 winter material makes the comforter keep warm in the whole night. The Comforter is stuffed with 260 GSM whole-piece microfiber. Each weighted near about 6 pounds. The bed skirt was use the same color flannel. All item of this bed in a bag are design for the cold weather. Warm your family Material- 2 style pillowcases: Some Customers like sleep around the fur, some may dislike. So we offer 2 style pillowcases to choose. 1 is fur and another is a quilted design, The Faux fur pillowcases were made of the same material with the comforter. The quilted pillowcases were made of quilted flannel fleece and fit the comforter well. Design: Luxurious and Warm bedding decoration, with a touch of gorgeousness, Super warm and cozy for the night. Suit for bedroom, guest room, kids room. Super great gift choice for the coming Christmas and Thanks Giving Day, New Year's Day. CUSTOMER SERVICE INCLUDED -- If you have any question about our product, please feel free to contact us on Amazon. Uozzi Home will help you in 24h :) Easy Care: Machine washable. Dries quick on tumble dry low. BTW：The comforter is little big for some small wash, pls try to find a bigger one. To Keep it fluffy, PLS DON'T DRY IT HIGH. Item comes in vacuum packing. When you open it, it maybe looks a bit flat, pls shake it for a while and the comforter will become fluffy in few minutes. If you have question, pls contact Uozzi Home on amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710GraESjBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UOZZI BEDDING","source_asin":"B09GF9MSV8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GF9MSV8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GF9MSV8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
