window.products.push({"id":600772,"name":"Y YHY Pasta Bowl Set of 4, White Pasta Bowl Plates, Porcelain Soup Bowls 15oz, Scallop Design, Wide and Shallow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6150z3J8v0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size: diameter: 9 inch, depth: 1.5 inch, capacity 15oz, suitable for serving salad, pasta, thick soup, rice, fruit, dessert, etc. Scallop Design: elegant and simple style, the scalloped edge makes them stand out with your table setting. Wide and Shallow: wide area gives you more space to hold salad or pasta, while preventing food spilling. Also made for easy storage. High Fired Porcelain: resist crazing and chipping, durable for long-lasting use. Microwave, oven, dishwasher and refrigerator safe. Ideal Gift Option: YHY scallop soup bowls make the personalized gifts for your favorite mom, wife, aunt, grandma, just to put a smile on their face.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6150z3J8v0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Y YHY","source_asin":"B0739P6GCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600772","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0739P6GCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0739P6GCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":600773,"name":"Mora Ceramic Kitchen Utensil Holder - Wooden Spoon & Spatula Crock for Countertop, Modern Farmhouse Home Decor, Extra Large 7.3\" Cooking Organizer for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oQxTMziiS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TURN YOUR KITCHEN INTO A HIT PAUSE ATMOSPHERE: Mora Ceramics is more than a mug. Mora is Latin for \"Pause\", acting as a reminder to slow down in your amazing life. You are always being told to do more, to go faster, to be better, but it's time for you to slow down and hit pause. Your Mora utensil holder can help you do that. Every time you see it in your kitchen it is a reminder to hit pause, give yourself some me time, and improve your overall well-being. LARGE AND STURDY: Our utensil crock is 6.3 inches wide and 7.3 inches tall, so it is able to hold up to 20 of your spoons and kitchen tools, and free up space in your drawers for easy access. Our Paladin ceramic clay is 20% stronger than other ceramics, so it won't chip or scratch. It's also heavy for extra stability and won't tip over. MODERN STYLE, CLEAN AESTHETICS: This isn't your grandmother's kitchen crock. Smooth lines give a sense of calm and simplicity while neutral colors make for a clean vibe. Perfect for the modern home. MULTIPLE USES: Not only is this crock perfect for storing your kitchen tools and spoons, it also works great as a wine chiller bucket, flower vase, office desk organizer, or bathroom storage. MORA’S 30 DAY PROMISE: Love your Mora product or return it for a 100% refund, no questions asked. Our customer service is available daily to hear your questions or concerns. Our objective is to help you hit pause, so we won’t settle for anything you don’t love. We’re not happy unless you are.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oQxTMziiS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MORA CERAMICS HIT PAUSE","source_asin":"B0BYTDLV23","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYTDLV23","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYTDLV23","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
