window.products.push({"id":600782,"name":"US 2005 California State Quarter BU Uncirculated Coin Silver Tone Key Chain Ring Bottle Opener NEW","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71chaj-UUNL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"A gorgeous silver tone key chain ring bottle opener, set with an authentic United States 2005 California State Quarter BU Uncirculated Coin. The opener is about 2.2\" x 1\" x 0.15\", brand new, and made of high quality metal alloy with silver plating. I only use these coins with readable dates, never try to clean them, and always keep their collectible and numismatic values. I hope you end up with one of these beautiful coin key chain ring bottle openers. This key chain ring bottle opener will be great for gift, or just adding to your coin/jewelry collection. I will be happy to combine shipping for multiple items. Thanks!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71chaj-UUNL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B01IU1ZJ5G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IU1ZJ5G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IU1ZJ5G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
