window.products.push({"id":600817,"name":"Masterpiece Artist Canvas 41956 Vincent PRO 7/8\" Deep, 24\" x 30\", Cotton 14.6oz - 4X - Sierra Heavy Weight","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41F83XT89zL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This 24x30 size is in the 5:4 Aspect Ratio. Sierra is our #12 heavy weight cotton duck canvas finished at 14.6 oz., sized and triple primed with archival quality acrylic gesso, producing a ground impervious to paints leaching through and harming the fabric. Suitable for most all paint types, like oils, acrylics, and alkyds. With it's heavier weight, it tends to be stronger and slightly more uniform than other heavy weight canvases in it's class. And it's ideal for heavy paint or impasto. There is a 5/16\" gap between the canvas and frame, eliminating the unwanted lines that occur when the gap is less. We never use finger joints in our wood frames, which often fail under tension and over time - the glue joints give up, and are unsuitable for paintings intended to last for centuries. Patented 3.25\" wide heavy duty keyable cross braces allow the canvas frame to be tensioned in the middle, where the tension is needed the most! The Stretcher Bars are slotted in the center to accept the cross braces. Due to our unique design, the cross braces provide maximum rigidity and may be removed, if desired. Both corner keys and brace keys are pre-installed. Stretched using our proprietary MuseumWrap method, producing a drum-tight-stretch, up to 50% tighter than other methods, and with balanced tension across the surface. The corners are uncut and neatly folded, making it possible to remove and restretch the canvas on the same size frame. From the Manufacturer For 50+ years, the passion of the Masterpiece team is building the finest artist canvas in America.  Just touch one of these impressive products and you’ll immediately discern the quality characteristics that separate this canvas from any other. Masterpiece takes pride in using high quality materials, employing unparalleled workmanship, and continually upping the bar on quality. The importance of artists using a quality made canvas cannot be overstressed.  If you use high quality paints and brushes, then don’t waste your resources on an inferior canvas not worthy of your own time, talent, and reputation.Masterpiece canvases are built to last well beyond the artist's lifetime…into the next millennium.  Savvy art buyers and art enthusiasts understand that the value of a painting increases when the materials used to create it are of equal quality to the artwork itself.  Using a well-made canvas is an investment in your own legacy.Why are Masterpiece canvases so good?  It starts with the canvas itself.  Natural fiber canvas materials, like 100% cotton and Belgian Linen, are selected and inspected. A sizing is then applied to the canvas that becomes a barrier between the ultimate primer and the canvas material.  The primer is specifically designed to provide the ultimate surface upon which your paints will join with the canvas, either chemically and/or mechanically, providing a reliable base or ground for your art.The canvas is then mounted onto a state-of-the-art Vincent Pro frame. When frame sizes are 16” or larger, a brace is applied to the frame; for example, a 12x16 has a single brace, and a 16x16 is cross braced in both directions. The braces prevent the stretcher bar frame from bowing-in so the canvas stays tighter….which is a welcome feature when you paint on the canvas, making the surface more responsive to the artist’s touch. And the canvas stays tight after it’s painted. To increase the tension further, press-in the corner keys and the brace keys further into the slots, which adds tension in the corners and the middle of the canvas, where the tension is needed the most!Vincent Pro canvas is MuseumWrapped, which is Masterpiece’s proprietary stretching technique that achieves: a drum-tight stretch, balanced tension across the canvas surface, neatly folded un-cut corners, and paintable edges. It’s the absolute best way to stretch a canvas.When your art matters, choose Vincent Pro…a truly professional canvas in every way!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41F83XT89zL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Masterpiece","source_asin":"B006GY60US","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600817","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006GY60US","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006GY60US","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":600818,"name":"HAWSON Big 1 Gallon Water Jug Insulated with Straw Handle Lid 128oz Sport Bottle Water Stainless Steel Cold Water Bottles with Paracord Handle Wide Mo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HVpWp0swL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Superior Insulation】- Designed with Triple wall vacuum insulation featuring dual stainless steel and an extra copper plate, HAWSON 64oz/128oz insulated water bottle keeps the bottle sweat-free, preserving cold for up to 48 hours and hot 24 hours. Newest insulation technology consistently blocks heat transfer and keeps cold or hot longer, so you can drink the freshest at any time. Matt powder coating on the outside enhances insulation and offers a steady grab and protects against scratches. 【Multifunctional Paracord Handle】- Come with multifunctional tools inclued compass, whistle, safety ring, carabiner and military grade paracord, it will make walkers, athletes, travelers, hikers, campers, students and busy moms go to everywhere easily and safely. Emergency whistles can help you remind and ask for help! The compass can guide you when lost outdoors. In special cases, our ropes can be disassembled and used for shoelace, hunting, fixed wounds, fixed emergency shelter and so on. 【Healthy Material】- HAWSON is committed to designing more durable, elegant and humanized water bottle. Made of food-grade 18/8 stainless steel, the stainless steel water bottle is fully resistant to oxidation, corrosion and odor resistant, so it will never leave a metal taste or rust. We only adopt BPA-free, lead free and recyclable materials, giving you or your family and friends a healthier and safer way to drink water. 【Humanized Features】- Providing 2 different lid covers included spout lid and straw lid, you can get fast water flow with the spout lid or sip smooth water without air leaking with the straw lid. Wide mouth design helps to easily fill with ice. Equipped with upgraded silicone seal in the lids, the stainless steel water bottle is 100% leak proof. Inclued 2 lids with handle, paracord handle, carabinerit and bottle wall, 5 way can help you easily carry the bottle to everywhere. 【Ideal Gift for Everyone】- HAWSON gallon water bottle with colorful paracord handle comes with color combos and multiple colors to choose, it is a great gift ideal for your family and friends to help them keep hydrated and healthier. Our factories follow a strict set of specifications and quality standards, however, if a problem develops, we will provide you with the best solution!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HVpWp0swL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAWSON","source_asin":"B09DSPZ83V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DSPZ83V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DSPZ83V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":600819,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Linea 4-Piece Placesetting, Service for 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31K09QM142L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Pfaltzgraff Linea 4-pc placesetting, service for one. Set includes: one of each dinner plate, salad plate, mug and soup/cereal bowl. This tone-on-tone white, grey and metallic pattern achieves the perfect balance between formal and casual dining. At first glance, this pattern appears to be simple, but is actually very intricate. Metallic lines and vine decoration weaves through the design set on unique shapes. Amazon.com Add a touch of sophisticated elegance to your table with this white, gray, and metallic tone-on-tone 4-piece place setting. Striking a nice balance between casual and formal dining, the organically based design appears simple at first glance but reveals more intricate patterning and details over time; the design includes wispy, flowing leaf-and-vine patterns that subtly grace the composed pattern. Each place setting includes an 11-3/4-inch dinner plate, a 9-inch salad plate, a 20-ounce mug, and a 28-ounce bowl. Made of stoneware, the items are safe in the dishwasher, microwave, and freezer, letting you spend more time enjoying meals and less time preparing or cleaning up after them. Pfaltzgraff warrants the set for defects within five years. Coordinate with other items from the Linea pattern, which includes more than 20 other items. --Jeff Dalto What's in the Box 1 place setting. Place setting consists of: 11-3/4-inch dinner plate, a 9-inch salad plate, a 20-ounce mug, and a 28-ounce soup/cereal bowl. 4 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31K09QM142L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B0007OESKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007OESKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007OESKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
