window.products.push({"id":600858,"name":"JOSTYLE 6FT Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Tree,Partially Flocked Christmas Tree with 300 UL-Certified LED Lights and 1218 Branch Tips for Christmas Par","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-2I3cIfAL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Snow Flocked Design】This Christmas tree is designed with flocking. The snow-white branches and warm white UL lights create a festive atmosphere. This beautiful christmas tree can make your home more festive and let your family enjoy the holiday. 【UL Certificated Pre-lit LED Design】This tree is equipped with 300 LED lights for 6FT and 600 LED lights for 7.5FT. These small LED bulbs are evenly distributed on each branch, which can make our Christmas tree emit warm and soft white light. All LED light bulbs have passed UL's safety certification to ensure their durability and safety. 【Pine Cones and Red Berries】 With pre-decorated with real large brown pine cones and red berries to make the Christmas tree look more colorful. Our Christmas tree is made of metal hinges, which is very strong and can support any decoration, so that you can design a personalized appearance and bring a warm holiday atmosphere to your family. 【Sturdy Metal Base】Compared with other cheap plastic base, our reinforced metal base will provide the tree with greater support and ensure good stability. Foldable stand with 2' diameter can prevent the tree from tilting or falling. And non-slip foot pads can protect the floor from scratches. Warning: Please remove the plastic cap which is useless before installation. If damaged or missing when received, not impact any usage effect. 【Simple Setup and Storage】 Put the tree together in just 3 steps, easy to disassemble and store. And the hinged branches will expand easier to save your time and energy. Just arrange it a little, hang the decorations, and a beautiful Christmas tree is finished. 【Fast Delivery & 5 Year Warranty 】Receive SOON .Ship from 13 U.S. based warehouses. All of our products come with a limited 5 year warranty. OVERALL DIMENSIONS: 41\"(Dia) x 72\"(H) for 6FT, 51\"(Dia) x 90\"(H) for 7.5FT","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-2I3cIfAL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOSTYLE","source_asin":"B09G3HRSGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600858","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G3HRSGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G3HRSGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":600859,"name":"VIPEK V9 Garment Racks for Hanging Clothes Heavy Duty Clothes Rack Metal Clothing Rack with Shelves & Basket, Freestanding Portable Closet Wardrobe 67","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":142.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DirxRVccL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dimensions: 67″ L x 16.5″ W x 72.9″ H. Strong Bearing Capacity: This heavy-duty wardrobe rack is made of high quality iron, it supports up to 560 pounds of clothes, shoes, and accessories. Hanging rod holds up to 90lbs and wire shelf holds up to 88lbs. Multifunctional Closet Rack: This clothing rack comes with 4 wire shelves, 2 hanging rods and 2 slide storage baskets to accommodate a range of clothing items. The height of shelves is adjustable with the easy-to-use slip-sleeve locking system. You can move it higher or lower according to your clothes length. Two Types of Installations: This clothes rack has 2 different Installation methods for varied size rooms. “I” shape for walk-in closet and cloakroom clothing store. “L” shape for small spaces like corner, apartment, bedroom. Easy to Assemble: Our wire garment rack is easy to assemble with clear instruction. Certain shelves must be installed in a particular order. Except for the manual, you can also refer to the installation video on the page","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DirxRVccL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIPEK","source_asin":"B0B51KH6RX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B51KH6RX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B51KH6RX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":600860,"name":"Modern Threads Pax 6-Piece Reversible Yarn Dyed Jacquard Towel Set - Bath Towels, Hand Towels, & Washcloths - Super Absorbent & Quick Dry - 100% Combe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.84,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910EYdl+2HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Timeless Yarn Dyed Jacquard Towel Set: Give your bathroom a facelift with our 6-piece jacquard towel set. Including two hand towels (a solid & a jacquard), two washcloths (both solid), and two bath towels (a solid & a jacquard), they're supremely soft and highly absorbent. Perfect for your personal and guest bathrooms, spruce up your decor with our luxurious, hotel-quality towels. Quick-Drying & Super-Absorbent Design: Expertly weaved with impeccable 550 GSM combed-cotton, our jacquard towels are designed to quickly soak up water after a long bath or shower. Immerse yourself in plush spa-like quality every time you dry off. Our towels are Oeko-Tex Standard 100 certified, showing success in crafting healthy products that are also good for the environment. Made From 100% Combed Cotton: We source only the best materials for our luxury bath towel collection. That's why our contemporary jacquard towels feature pure combed cotton that's both soft and strong. They're easy to maintain with a cold machine wash and low tumble dry—and they get even softer with every wash. Elevate Your Personal or Guest Bathroom Décor: Offered in a variety of timeless gold, brown, blue, and sage hues, beautify your bathroom decor with our trefoil filigree jacquard set. Use them as decorative hand towels for your guests, upgrade your personal towels, or gift a set to your loved ones. One thing's for sure: you'll immerse yourself in pure luxury that harkens back to your favorite vacation each time you use them. Dedicated To Providing Your Home With Luxurious Textiles: At Modern Threads, we've been dedicated to providing quality textiles at the intersection of luxury and functionality for over 40 years. As a family-owned brand, we understand your priorities in arranging a modern and comfortable home. That's why we source only the best materials and craft luxurious products to last for years to come. Every item is designed with care by our California studio team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910EYdl+2HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modern Threads","source_asin":"B0BXXLJQSV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXXLJQSV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXXLJQSV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
