window.products.push({"id":600957,"name":"Scentsationals Day of The Dead Collection - Scented Wax Cube Warmer - Wax Fragrance Melter - Skull Wickless Electronic Home Air Freshener Gift (Noche ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ljFsfBk5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DAY OF THE DEAD HOLIDAY - Originated in Mexico, celebrate both life and death with this holiday wax cube warmer. They feature unique shapes and designs with flowers that will look amazing as decor in your home. This warmer includes breathable holes that create a gentle glow in your room when plugged in. Gentle light adds a touch of ambiance. AMAZING FRAGRANCES - ScentSationals is the leader in wax warmers and wax melts. Choose from hundreds of different scents of waxes to use with your new wax burner. ScentSationals scented wax fragrance families include; Fresh, Floral, Wood, Fruit, Bakery and Spice. (Wax cubes sold separately) SAFE OPERATION - Our wickless warmers do not use open flames or have soot residue. It's an easy-to-use and clean heat source. They connect to a standard outlet with a 120 volt cord and have an on/off dial to easily operate. The light bulb (included) heats up the wax that's on the wax dish. As the wax melts, fragrances will fill the room. EASY CLEANUP & REUSE - There are multiple ways to clean wax warmers to prepare for a new wax cube. 1) Cotton Ball Method: Add cotton balls to soak up majority of the wax, turn off and wait until wax cools, then throw away cotton balls and wipe down hot plate. 2) Soft Wax Method: Let wax cool, turn on warmer for 2-3 minutes, then remove softened wax. SATISFIED CUSTOMERS - ScentSationals has had millions of satisfied customers. Each wax burner that we have goes through multiple extensive tests to ensure safety and quality. If you're looking to freshen up your home, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, or any other rooms in your house, this is your top solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ljFsfBk5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scentsationals","source_asin":"B09FNTGRNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-600957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FNTGRNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FNTGRNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
